  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "音樂與生活美學",
    "sub_ename": "MUSIC AND LIFE AESTHETICS",
    "describe_ch": "在科技日新月異的時代，我們如何用音樂提升生活的質感？本課程將帶領學生透過簡單易懂的方式，探索音樂與生活的關聯，並運用AI工具來創作、分析與體驗音樂的美學價值。我們將從日常生活中的聲音出發，認識不同文化的音樂風格，學習如何透過數位科技讓音樂變得更有趣，最終幫助學生找到能讓自己放鬆、抒發情感、提升創造力的音樂方式。",
    "describe_eh": "In an era of rapidly advancing technology, how can we use music to enhance the quality of our lives? This course will guide students in exploring the connection between music and daily life through simple and accessible approaches. By incorporating AI tools, students will learn to create, analyze, and experience the aesthetic value of music. Starting from everyday sounds, the course introduces various musical styles from different cultures and teaches how digital technology can make music more engaging. Ultimately, students will discover personalized ways to relax, express emotions, and boost creativity through music.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
